        "topMargin": "5",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">“It’s all about passing on accurate information to leaders so they can make informed decisions,” he says. “If we’re not taking customers and patient voices into consideration, we would be doing them an injustice.” </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">- Mike Mills</span></span></span></p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 25 2022 14:39:49 GMT+0000",
