    "text_1396992431": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:title": "The",
      "cq:masterBuildingBlock": true,
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue May 24 2022 20:35:29 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 25 2022 14:27:14 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "cq/experience-fragments/editor/components/buildingblock",
      "text_13969924313238623789540191": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
        "text": "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/about/news/2021/stryker-expands-its-mako-smartrobotics-footprint-to-reach-more-v.html\">placement of Mako SmartRobotics systems in VA and military hospitals across the country</a> is just one of many efforts happening across Stryker to support military members and veterans.</p>\n<p>From supporting active and veteran employees through Stryker’s Veterans Association (SVA) Employee Resource Group to our involvement with K9s For Warriors, an organization that helps veterans suffering from the invisible wounds of war by providing them with service dogs, our passion for our nation’s heroes is exemplified in many ways.</p>\n<p>The mission to make healthcare better will never be complete. Together, we’ll keep working alongside our customers, creating new and innovative products and services—and our veterans will help lead the way. “We have such an opportunity to make a difference,” Mike says.<br>\n</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 25 2022 15:47:18 GMT+0000",
